ize":827,"digest":"sha256:657b26eb9aef049d4cfde1e606ecbc9d5d9fca6f03e30b5144c35d900a25b09f","download_count":335,"created_at":"2026-10-10T02:59:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T02:59:54Z"},{"id":626826044,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84lXJs8","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:dd6f83b692033959636a2c54368cf402e8453760b37b959183ee598b48fdc26d","download_count":483,"created_at":"2026-10-10T02:50:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T02:50:09Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 新建聊天改为响应式页面，使用 Agent 卡片选择助手，并复用聊天输入框与会话设置 (#3333)\n- 新建聊天记住上次使用的模型、工作目录、启动方式和推理选项，方便连续创建会话 (#3333)\n- Agent 卡片新增金色边框与玉色流光，并统一各平台卡片内部动画的速度 (#3336、#3344)\n- 修复 Agent 卡片循环切换时的缩放跳变，以及鼠标在列表外释放后仍会拖动的问题 (#3335、#3340)\n- 修复长数字、符号或空白文本导致 Token 计算卡顿、聊天无响应的问题 (#3325)\n- 完善上下文用量估算与自动压缩，计入工具调用和模型实际用量，修复工具组跨压缩边界时无法压缩的问题 (#3329)\n- 修复编程 Agent 因依赖输出调试日志而中断聊天的问题，提高 DSH 和其他 ACP Agent 的兼容性 (#3327)\n- 修复不同 Hermes 内核版本下澄清问题与回答回调的兼容性问题 (#3330)\n- 手机网页端侧边栏与 App 保持一致，宽度采用屏幕的 90%、最大 380px，改善较宽屏幕上的显示 (#3346)\n- Studio 与桌面端版本同步更新为 `0.7.33`，前端更新日志补齐 11 种语言并保留最近三个版本 (#3345)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(tokens): guard quadratic BPE for digit/symbol/whitespace runs by @WenhuaXia in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3325\n* fix Hermes clarify callbacks across kernel versions by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3330\n* [codex] replace new-chat drawer with responsive Agent cards by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3333\n* [codex] fix Agent card scaling at click loop boundaries by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3335\n* [codex] add gold and jade foil to Agent cards by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3336\n* fix(coding-agents): tolerate dependency stdout noise on ACP pipes by @WenhuaXia in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3327\n* fix(chat-run): count tool_calls and real usage in bridge context estimate by @chloeassistant in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3329\n* [codex] stop Agent cards dragging after mouse release outside the list by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3340\n* [codex] keep new-chat card interior animations at a consistent speed by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3344\n* chore: prepare Studio 0.7.33 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3345\n* [codex] match mobile sidebar width to App by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3346\n\n## New Contributors\n* @chloeassistant made their first contribution in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3329\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.32...v0.7.33\n","mentions_count":3}
